'en','Menu',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4556,'message_account_created','en','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>we are pleased to inform you that your account for the {company_name_short} CRM system has been successfully created.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Username:</strong> {username}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🔒</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Password:</strong> {password}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🌐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Login:</strong><br><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px;\" href=\"{app_link}\">To the CRM System</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>We recommend that you save your password immediately after your first login and you can adjust it at any time in your account settings.</p>\n<p>If you have any questions, we are happy to assist you.</p>\n<p>Best regards<br>Your {company_name_short} Team</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 10:12:16',1),(4558,'message_businesspartner_invitation','en','<div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px;\"><div style=\"padding: 20px;\"><p>{salutation},</p><p>we are now using Sygeta\'s new CRM system and would like to invite you to become a sales partner.</p><p>{partner_registration_description}</p><p>You can find more information about our company on our website:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"{company_website}\" style=\"color: #007bff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;\">{company_website}</a></p><p>Please register as a sales partner - just click here:</p><div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a href=\"{register_link}\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;\">Register as a Partner now</a></div><p>If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.</p><p style=\"margin: 0;\">Kind regards,<br>Your {company_name} Team</p></div></div>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4559,'message_event_cancelled','en','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>We regret to inform you that the following event has been cancelled:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #ffebee; border-left: 5px solid #c62828; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Title:</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong> {event_time}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">❌</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Status:</strong> <span style=\"color: #c62828; font-weight: bold;\">Cancelled</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>The event may be rescheduled at a later date. You will receive a new invitation if this happens.</p>\n<p>This email was sent automatically. Please do not reply to it.</p>\n<p>Best regards<br>Your {company_name_short} Team</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 06:15:19',1),(4560,'message_event_confirmation','en','<h1>Event Registration Confirmation</h1><p>{salutation},</p><p>Thank you for registering for the webinar <strong>{webinar_title}</strong>.</p><p><strong>Webinar Date and Time:</strong> {webinar_date}</p><p><strong>Description:</strong> {webinar_description}</p><p>You can join the webinar via the following link:</p><p><a href=\"{webinar_link}\">Join the webinar</a></p><p>We look forward to seeing you there!</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4562,'message_event_invitation','en','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>You are cordially invited to an event. Here are the details:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Title:</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Start:</strong> {event_start}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>End:</strong> {event_end}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Location:</strong> {event_venue}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Description:</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n<table 