has been updated. Please note the new information.</p>\n<p>With kind regards,</p>\n<p><strong>Your team from {organization_name} \n</strong></p><hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;\">If you have any questions, you can reach us at <a href=\"mailto:{contact_email}\" style=\"color: #2980b9;\">{contact_email}</a> or by telephone at {contact_phone}.</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4565,'message_jg0o0wyt','en','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #333;\">\n<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>{customer_full_name} has booked a personal online meeting with you. Below you will find the details.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Customer:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting Time:</strong> {meeting_time}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duration:</strong> {duration}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Please use the button below to join the meeting:</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #28a745; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{video_link_moderator}\">🎥 Join Video Meeting</a></div>\n<p>Please be prepared and ensure you are ready at the agreed time.</p>\n<p>Kind regards<br>Your {company_name} Team</p>\n</div>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-11 16:16:20',1),(4568,'message_meeting_invitation','en','<p>Hello {firstname} {lastname} ,</p>\n<p>We would like to invite you to a personal meeting with our team. During this appointment, we will discuss all relevant topics and answer your questions individually.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong>: {duration}</p>\n<p>Simply choose a time that suits you best. With just one click, you can conveniently book your preferred meeting date online:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> Select date now </a></p>\n<p>We look forward to talking to you!</p>\n<p>With kind regards<br>Your {company_name} Team</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4570,'message_partner_account_created','en','\n <table width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#f4f4f4\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n   <tr>\n     <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 40px 0;\">\n       <table width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" cellpadding=\"40\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n         <tr>\n           <td>\n             <h2 style=\"color: #333333;\">{salutation},</h2>\n             <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                Thank you very much for your registration at <strong>{app_name}</strong>!\n             </p>\n             <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                To complete your registration, please confirm your e-mail address by clicking on the button below:\n             </p>\n             <p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n               <a href=\"{link}\" style=\"background-color: #007BFF; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px;\">\n                  Confirm e-mail address\n               </a>\n             </p>\n             <p style=\"color: #999999; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                If the button does not work, you can also open this link in your browser:<br>\n               <a href=\"{link}\" style=\"color: #007BFF;\">{link}</a>\n             </p>\n             <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 40px;\">\n                If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.<br>\n                <br>\n                Yours sincerely,<br>\n                Your team from</p> </td> </tr> </table> </td> </tr> </table> {app_name}\n               \n <table width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#f4f4f4\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"> <tr> <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 40px 0;\"> <table width=\"600\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" cellpadding=\"40\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"> <tr> <td>          </td>\n         </tr>\n       </table>\n       <p style=\"color: #cccccc; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n          © {year} {app_name} . All rights reserved.\n       </p>\n     </td>\n   </tr>\n </table>\n',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(4571,'message_phone_follow_up_mail','en','<p>Hello {firstname},</p><p>Thank you for the pleasant phone call today! It was nice to get to know you personally and learn more about your requirements and goals.</p><p>As discussed, I am happy to send you further information about our services:</p><div>{our_services}</div><p>If you have any further questions or would like to discuss individual points in more detail, please feel free to contact me at any time. You can reach me at <a href=\"tel:{partner_phone}\">{partner_phone}</a> or by email at <a href=\"mailto:{partner_mail}\">{partner_mail}</a>.</p><p>You can also find more details about {company_name} on our website: <a href=\"{company_website}\" tar