fiche ensuite le message dans une notification Toast, en appliquant la classe CSS spécifiée au message. Le message disparaît automatiquement après un court laps de temps, à moins que le message ne nécessite une confirmation de la part de l\'utilisateur.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10092,'country_mv','fr','Maldives',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10093,'currency_name_lbp','es','Libra libanesa',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10094,'currency_name_lbp','fr','Livre libanaise',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10095,'currency_name_lbp','hi','लेबनानी पाउंड',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10096,'currency_name_lbp','ja','レバノンポンド',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10097,'currency_name_lbp','ru','Ливанский фунт',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10098,'currency_name_lbp','tr','Lübnan lirası',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10099,'currency_name_lbp','uk','Ліванський фунт',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10100,'currency_name_lbp','zh','黎巴嫩镑',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10101,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','es','Nueva cita de visita',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10102,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','fr','Nouveau rendez-vous de visite',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10103,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','hi','नई निरीक्षण अपॉइंटमेंट',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10104,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','ja','新しい内覧予約',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10105,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','ru','Новая дата осмотра',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10106,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','tr','Yeni Ziyaret Randevusu',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10107,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','uk','Нова дата огляду',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(10108,'mail_subject_subject_property_inspection_partner','zh','新的看房预约',NUL