 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🗓️</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date :</strong> {event_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Heure :</strong> {event_time}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Description :</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\">\n<table style=\"margin: 0 auto;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 0 10px;\"><a style=\"background-color: #4caf50; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{invitation_link}?response=accept\">✅ Je participe</a></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0 10px;\"><a style=\"background-color: #f44336; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{invitation_link}?response=decline\">❌ Je refuse</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Veuillez confirmer votre participation via les boutons ci-dessus.</p>\n<p>Nous nous réjouissons de votre participation !</p>\n<p>Cordialement<br><strong>{inviter_name}</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 17:41:39',1),(15794,'resource_title_sales_document_detail_view','fr','Vue détaillée du ticket de caisse',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(15795,'your_web_app','fr','Votre application web',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(15797,'send_email','fr','Envoyer un e-mail',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(15798,'save_customer','fr','Enregistrer le client',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(15799,'country_bz','fr','Belize',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(15800,'country_dj','fr