: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">IT分野で25年のCEO経験</span>\n </div>\n <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-right: 20px;\">🧬</span>\n  <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">8年間の集中的な研究開発</span>\n </div>\n <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-right: 20px;\">💸</span>\n  <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">世界で最も安いIT企業</span>\n </div>\n <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-right: 20px;\">🎨</span>\n  <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">Fortune 500企業で働いたデザイナー</span>\n </div>\n <div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-right: 20px;\">🧠</span>\n  <span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">超低価格で高度なソフトウェア</span>\n </div>\n </div>\n </div>\n\n <!-- Final Welcome -->\n <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B6B, #4ECDC4); color: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n <div style=\"font-size: 100px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">🎉🚀✨</div>\n <h3 style=\"font-size: 40px; margin: 0 0 20px 0; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n    METAYOTAファミリーへようこそ！\n </h3>\n <p style=\"font-size: 24px; margin: 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n    一緒に素晴らしいテクノロジーソリューションを創造しましょう！\n </p>\n </div>\n\n </div>\n\n <!-- Footer -->\n <div style=\"background: #2C3E50; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n <p style=\"font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: bold;\">\n   敬具、<br>\n <span style=\"color: #F1C40F; font-size: 28px;\">JOEL J.</span><br>\n <span style=\"color: #3498DB;\">CEO, METAYOTA CORP.</span>\n