xt-transform: capitalize;\">{event_type}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border: 1px solid #28a745; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"color: #155724; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">🔗 Am Event teilnehmen</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #155724;\">Klicken Sie auf den untenstehenden Link, um am Event teilzunehmen:</p><a style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background-color: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\" href=\"{join_link}\"> Jetzt am Event teilnehmen </a><p style=\"margin: 15px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d;\">Link: {join_link}</p></div><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffc107; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #856404; font-weight: bold;\">⏳ Verbleibende Zeit: {time_until_event}</p></div><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 30px;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #495057;\">Mit freundlichen Grüßen,</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50;\">{partner_full_name}</p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; color: #6c757d;\">{company_name}</p><div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\">Diese E-Mail wurde gesendet von {app_name}</p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0;\">&copy; {year} {company_name}. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.</p></div></div></div>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(26960,'message_webinar_reminder','en','<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n<h1 style=\"color: #2c3e50; margin: 0;\">{company_name}</h1>\n<p style=\"color: #7f8c8d; margin: 5px 0;\">{app_name}</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16