_date}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; font-weight: bold; background-color: #f8f9fa;\">⏰ Heure :</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\">{event_start_time} - {event_end_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; font-weight: bold; background-color: #f8f9fa;\">⏱️ Durée :</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\">{event_duration_hours}h {event_duration_minutes}min</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; font-weight: bold; background-color: #f8f9fa;\">🎯 Type :</td><td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; text-transform: capitalize;\">{event_type}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border: 1px solid #28a745; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;\"><h3 style=\"color: #155724; margin: 0 0 15px 0;\">🔗 Rejoignez l\'événement</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #155724;\">Cliquez sur le lien ci-dessous pour rejoindre l\'événement :</p><a style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background-color: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\" href=\"{join_link}\"> Rejoindre l\'événement maintenant </a><p style=\"margin: 15px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d;\">Lien : {join_link}</p></div><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border: 1px solid #ffc107; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #856404; font-weight: bold;\">⏳ Temps restant : {time_until_event}</p></div><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 30px;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #495057;\">Cordialement,</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50;\">{partner_full_name}</p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; color: #6c757d;\">{company_name}</p><div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: