o invite you to a personal meeting with our team at our location. During this appointment, we will discuss all relevant topics and answer your questions individually.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duration:</strong> {duration}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting Location:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Directions:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Simply choose a time that suits you best. With just one click, you can conveniently book your preferred meeting date online:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Select date now </a></p>\n<p>We look forward to meeting you in person!</p>\n<p>With kind regards<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29433,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','de','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Wir möchten Sie zu einem persönlichen Gespräch mit unserem Team an unserem Standort einladen. Während dieses Termins werden wir alle relevanten Themen besprechen und Ihre Fragen individuell beantworten.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Dauer:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Besprechungsort:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Wegbeschreibung:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Wählen Sie einfach einen Zeitpunkt, der Ihnen am besten passt. Mit nur einem Klick können Sie Ihren bevorzugten Besprechungstermin bequem online buchen:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Jetzt Termin auswählen </a></p><p>Wir freuen uns darauf, Sie persönlich kennenzulernen!</p><p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29434,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','fr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Nous aimerions vous inviter à une rencontre personnelle avec notre équipe dans nos locaux. Lors de ce rendez-vous, nous discuterons de tous les sujets pertinents et répondrons à vos questions individuellement.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Durée :</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lieu de la rencontre :</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Accès :</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Choisissez simplement l\'heure qui vous convient le mieux. En un seul clic, vous pouvez facilement réserver votre date de rendez-vous préférée en ligne :</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Choisir une date maintenant </a></p><p>Nous sommes impatients de vous rencontrer en personne !</p><p>Cordialement,<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29435,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','ja','<p>{salutation}様、</p><p>当社のオフィスにて、弊社チームとの個人面談にご招待いたします。この面談では、関連するすべての議題について話し合い、個別にご質問にお答えいたします。</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>所要時間:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>面談場所:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>アクセス:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>ご都合の良い時間帯をお選びください。ワンクリックで、ご希望の面談日時をオンラインで簡単に予約できます。</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 今すぐ日程を選択する </a></p><p>皆様にお会いできるのを楽しみにしております！</p><p>よろしくお願いいたします。<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29436,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','es','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Nos gustaría invitarte a una reunión personal con nuestro equipo en nuestras instalaciones. Durante esta cita, discutiremos todos los temas relevantes y responderemos a tus preguntas individualmente.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duración:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ubicación de la reunión:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Indicaciones:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Simplemente elige la hora que mejor se adapte a ti. Con solo un clic, puedes reservar cómodamente tu fecha de reunión preferida en línea:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Seleccionar fecha ahora </a></p><p>¡Esperamos conocerte en persona!</p><p>Saludos cordiales<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29437,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','tr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Ekibimizle yerimizde kişisel bir toplantıya davet etmek isteriz. Bu randevu sırasında tüm ilgili konuları görüşecek ve sorularınızı bireysel olarak yanıtlayacağız.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Süre:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Toplantı Yeri:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Yol Tarifi:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Size en uygun zamanı seçmeniz yeterli. Tek bir tıklamayla tercih ettiğiniz toplantı tarihini çevrimiçi olarak kolayca rezerve edebilirsiniz:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Şimdi tarih seç </a></p><p>Sizinle şahsen tanışmayı dört gözle bekliyoruz!</p><p>Saygılarımızla<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29438,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','ru','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Мы хотели бы пригласить вас на личную встречу с нашей командой в нашем офисе. Во время этой встречи мы обсудим все актуальные темы и ответим на ваши вопросы индивидуально.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Продолжительность:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Место встречи:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Как добраться:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Просто выберите удобное для вас время. Всего одним кликом вы можете удобно забронировать желаемую дату встречи онлайн:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Выбрать дату сейчас </a></p><p>С нетерпением ждем личной встречи!</p><p>С уважением,<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29439,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','uk','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Ми хотіли б запросити вас на особисту зустріч з нашою командою у нашому офісі. Під час цієї зустрічі ми обговоримо всі важливі теми та індивідуально відповімо на ваші запитання.</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Тривалість:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Місце зустрічі:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Маршрут:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Просто оберіть час, який вам найбільше підходить. Лише одним кліком ви можете зручно забронювати бажану дату зустрічі онлайн:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 Обрати дату зараз </a></p><p>Ми з нетерпінням чекаємо на особисту зустріч з вами!</p><p>З повагою<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29440,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','hi','<p>{salutation},</p><p>हम आपको हमारे स्थान पर हमारी टीम के साथ एक व्यक्तिगत बैठक के लिए आमंत्रित करना चाहेंगे। इस अपॉइंटमेंट के दौरान, हम सभी प्रासंगिक विषयों पर चर्चा करेंगे और आपके प्रश्नों का व्यक्तिगत रूप से उत्तर देंगे।</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अवधि:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>बैठक का स्थान:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिशा-निर्देश:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>बस वह समय चुनें जो आपको सबसे अच्छा लगे। केवल एक क्लिक से, आप अपनी पसंदीदा मीटिंग की तारीख ऑनलाइन आसानी से बुक कर सकते हैं:</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 अभी तारीख चुनें </a></p><p>हम आपसे व्यक्तिगत रूप से मिलने के लिए उत्सुक हैं!</p><p>साभार<br>{partner_full_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29441,'in_person_meeting_invitation_t2ngtnz7','zh','<p>{salutation}，</p><p>我们诚挚邀请您前来我们的办公地点与我们的团队进行一次面对面会谈。在本次会面中，我们将讨论所有相关主题并单独解答您的问题。</p><div style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>时长：</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会议地点：</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>路线指引：</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>只需选择一个最适合您的时间。您只需点击一下，即可在线方便地预订您首选的会议日期：</p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;\"><a style=\"background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 25px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;\" href=\"{book_meeting_link}\"> 📅 立即选择日期 </a></p><p>我们期待与您面对面交流！</p><p>此致<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29444,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','en','📅 Meeting confirmed - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29445,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','uk','📅 Зустріч підтверджено - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29446,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','de','📅 Treffen bestätigt - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29447,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','fr','📅 Réunion confirmée - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29448,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','tr','📅 Toplantı onaylandı - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29449,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','ja','📅 会議が確定しました - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29450,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','hi','📅 मीटिंग की पुष्टि हो गई है - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29451,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','zh','📅 会议已确认 - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29452,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','ru','📅 Встреча подтверждена - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29453,'subject_in_person_meeting_confirmation','es','📅 Reunión confirmada - {company_name} | {meeting_time}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29454,'title_in_person_meeting_confirm