tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting Location:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Directions:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>If you need to reschedule or have any questions, please don\'t hesitate to contact us.</p>\n<p>We look forward to meeting you in person!</p>\n<p>With kind regards<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29465,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','de','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Vielen Dank für Ihre Terminbuchung! Wir bestätigen Ihr Treffen mit unserem Team und freuen uns auf unser persönliches Gespräch.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Datum &amp; Uhrzeit:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Dauer:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Treffpunkt:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Anfahrt:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Sollten Sie den Termin verschieben müssen oder Fragen haben, zögern Sie bitte nicht, uns zu kontaktieren.</p><p>Wir freuen uns darauf, Sie persönlich kennenzulernen!</p><p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29466,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','fr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Nous vous remercions d\'avoir pris rendez-vous! Nous confirmons votre réunion avec notre équipe et nous nous réjouissons de notre conversation en personne.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date &amp; heure:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Durée:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lieu de rendez-vous:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Itinéraire:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Si vous avez besoin de reporter votre rendez-vous ou si vous avez des questions, n\'hésitez pas à nous contacter.</p><p>Nous avons hâte de vous rencontrer en personne!</p><p>Cordialement,<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29467,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','ja','<p>{salutation},</p><p>ご予約ありがとうございます。チームとの面談を確定いたしました。直接お話できることを楽しみにしております。</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日時:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>所要時間:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>面談場所:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>〒{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>道順:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>日程変更のご希望やご質問がございましたら、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p><p>直接お会いできるのを楽しみにしております！</p><p>敬具<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29468,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','es','<p>{salutation},</p><p>¡Gracias por reservar su cita! Confirmamos su reunión con nuestro equipo y esperamos con interés nuestra conversación personal.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fecha y hora:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duración:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lugar de la reunión:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Indicaciones:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Si necesita reprogramar o tiene alguna pregunta, no dude en contactarnos.</p><p>¡Esperamos verle en persona!</p><p>Atentamente<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29469,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','tr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Randevu rezervasyonunuz için teşekkür ederiz! Ekibimizle görüşmenizi onaylıyor ve kişisel sohbetimizi sabırsızlıkla bekliyoruz.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Tarih &amp; Saat:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Süre:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Toplantı Yeri:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Yol Tarifi:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Randevuyu yeniden planlamanız veya herhangi bir sorunuz olursa lütfen bizimle iletişime geçmekten çekinmeyin.</p><p>Sizinle şahsen tanışmayı dört gözle bekliyoruz!</p><p>Saygılarımızla<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29470,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','ru','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Благодарим Вас за запись на прием! Мы подтверждаем Вашу встречу с нашей командой и с нетерпением ждем личной беседы.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата и время:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Продолжительность:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Место встречи:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Как добраться:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Если Вам нужно перенести встречу или у Вас возникли вопросы, пожалуйста, не стесняйтесь обращаться к нам.</p><p>Мы с нетерпением ждем личной встречи с Вами!</p><p>С уважением<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29471,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','uk','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Дякуємо за бронювання зустрічі! Ми підтверджуємо Вашу зустріч з нашою командою та з нетерпінням чекаємо на особисту розмову.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата та час:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Тривалість:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Місце зустрічі:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Маршрут:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Якщо Вам потрібно перенести зустріч або виникли запитання, будь ласка, не соромтеся зв’язатися з нами.</p><p>Ми з нетерпінням чекаємо на особисту зустріч з Вами!</p><p>З повагою<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29472,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','hi','<p>{salutation},</p><p>आपकी अपॉइंटमेंट बुक करने के लिए धन्यवाद! हम हमारी टीम के साथ आपकी मीटिंग की पुष्टि करते हैं और हमारी व्यक्तिगत बातचीत की प्रतीक्षा कर रहे हैं।</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिनांक और समय:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अवधि:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>मीटिंग का स्थान:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिशा-निर्देश:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>यदि आपको पुनर्निर्धारित करना हो या कोई प्रश्न हों, तो कृपया हमसे संपर्क करने में संकोच न करें।</p><p>हम आपसे व्यक्तिगत रूप से मिलने की प्रतीक्षा कर रहे हैं!</p><p>साभार<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29473,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_8si7jv4b','zh','<p>{salutation}，</p><p>感谢您预约！我们确认您与我们团队的会面，期待与您进行面对面的交流。</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #28a745; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日期和时间：</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>时长：</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会议地点：</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span s