rong> {customer_full_name}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong> {meeting_time}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duration:</strong> {duration}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting Location:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Directions:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Please prepare accordingly and ensure you\'re available at the scheduled time.</p>\n<p>Have a successful meeting!</p>\n<p>With kind regards<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29495,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','de','<p>Hallo {partner_full_name},</p><p>Ein neuer Termin wurde über Ihr Terminplanungssystem gebucht. Alle Details finden Sie unten:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Kunde:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Datum &amp; Uhrzeit:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Dauer:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Besprechungsort:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Wegbeschreibung:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Bitte bereiten Sie sich entsprechend vor und stellen Sie sicher, dass Sie zum geplanten Zeitpunkt verfügbar sind.</p><p>Ich wünsche Ihnen ein erfolgreiches Treffen!</p><p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29496,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','fr','<p>Bonjour {partner_full_name},</p><p>Une nouvelle réunion a été réservée via votre système de planification. Veuillez trouver tous les détails ci-dessous :</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Client :</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date &amp; Heure :</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Durée :</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lieu de la réunion :</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Itinéraire :</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Veuillez vous préparer en conséquence et vous assurer d\'être disponible à l\'heure prévue.</p><p>Passez une réunion réussie !</p><p>Cordialement<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29497,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','ja','<p>{partner_full_name}様、</p><p>スケジューリングシステムを通じて、新しい会議が予約されました。詳細は以下の通りです。</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>お客様:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日時:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>所要時間:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会議場所:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>道順:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>ご準備いただき、予定時刻にご対応いただけますようお願いいたします。</p><p>会議が成功しますように！</p><p>よろしくお願いいたします<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29498,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','es','<p>Hola {partner_full_name},</p><p>Se ha reservado una nueva reunión a través de tu sistema de programación. A continuación, encontrarás todos los detalles:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Cliente:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fecha y Hora:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duración:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ubicación de la reunión:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Indicaciones:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Por favor, prepárate adecuadamente y asegúrate de estar disponible a la hora programada.</p><p>¡Que tengas una reunión exitosa!</p><p>Con un cordial saludo<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29499,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','tr','<p>Merhaba {partner_full_name},</p><p>Planlama sisteminiz aracılığıyla yeni bir toplantı rezerve edildi. Tüm detayları aşağıda bulabilirsiniz:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Müşteri:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Tarih ve Saat:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Süre:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Toplantı Yeri:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Yol Tarifi:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Lütfen buna göre hazırlanın ve planlanan saatte hazır bulunduğunuzdan emin olun.</p><p>Başarılı bir toplantı geçirmeniz dileğiyle!</p><p>Saygılarımızla<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29500,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','ru','<p>Здравствуйте, {partner_full_name},</p><p>Через вашу систему планирования была забронирована новая встреча. Ниже вы найдете все детали:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Клиент:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата и время:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Продолжительность:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Место встречи:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Как добраться:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Пожалуйста, подготовьтесь соответствующим образом и убедитесь, что вы доступны в назначенное время.</p><p>Желаем успешной встречи!</p><p>С уважением<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29501,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','uk','<p>Привіт, {partner_full_name},</p><p>Через вашу систему планування призначено нову зустріч. Будь ласка, ознайомтеся з усіма деталями нижче:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Клієнт:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата та час:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Тривалість:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Місце зустрічі:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Напрямок:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Будь ласка, підготуйтеся належним чином і переконайтеся, що ви доступні у призначений час.</p><p>Бажаємо успішної зустрічі!</p><p>З повагою<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29502,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','hi','<p>नमस्ते {partner_full_name},</p><p>आपके शेड्यूलिंग सिस्टम के माध्यम से एक नई मीटिंग बुक की गई है। कृपया सभी विवरण नीचे देखें:</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>ग्राहक:</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिनांक और समय:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अवधि:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>मीटिंग का स्थान:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिशा-निर्देश:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>कृपया उसी के अनुसार तैयारी करें और सुनिश्चित करें कि आप निर्धारित समय पर उपलब्ध हों।</p><p>आपकी मीटिंग सफल रहे!</p><p>शुभकामनाओं सहित<br>{app_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29503,'in_person_meeting_confirmation_partner_gpk686pj','zh','<p>您好，{partner_full_name}，</p><p>您的日程安排系统已预订了一个新的会议。请查看以下所有详细信息：</p><div style=\"background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 5px solid #ffc107; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">👤</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>客户：</strong> {customer_full_name}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日期和时间：</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>时长：</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会议地点：</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</t