rson_meeting_reminder','es','📅 Recordatorio de reunión - {company_name} en {time_until_meeting}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29644,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','uk','📅 Нагадування про зустріч - {company_name} за {time_until_meeting}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29645,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','ja','📅 会議のリマインダー - {company_name} {time_until_meeting}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29646,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','de','📅 Besprechungserinnerung - {company_name} in {time_until_meeting}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29647,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','tr','📅 Toplantı hatırlatıcısı - {company_name}, {time_until_meeting} içinde',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29648,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','hi','📅 मीटिंग रिमाइंडर - {company_name} {time_until_meeting} में',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29649,'subject_in_person_meeting_reminder','zh','📅 会议提醒 - {company_name} 在 {time_until_meeting}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29650,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','en','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>This is a friendly reminder about your upcoming meeting with our team. Your appointment is scheduled in {time_until_meeting}.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting in:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date &amp; Time:</strong> {meeting_time}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duration:</strong> {duration}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Meeting Location:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Directions:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Please plan your journey accordingly and don\'t hesitate to contact us if you need to reschedule or have any questions.</p>\n<p>We look forward to meeting you soon!</p>\n<p>With kind regards<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29651,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','de','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Dies ist eine freundliche Erinnerung an Ihr bevorstehendes Treffen mit unserem Team. Ihr Termin ist in {time_until_meeting} angesetzt.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Treffen in:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Datum &amp; Uhrzeit:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Dauer:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ort des Treffens:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Wegbeschreibung:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Bitte planen Sie Ihre Anreise entsprechend und zögern Sie nicht, uns zu kontaktieren, falls Sie den Termin verschieben müssen oder Fragen haben.</p><p>Wir freuen uns darauf, Sie bald zu treffen!</p><p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29652,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','fr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Ceci est un rappel amical concernant votre prochain rendez-vous avec notre équipe. Votre rendez-vous est prévu dans {time_until_meeting}.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Rendez-vous dans :</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date et heure :</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Durée :</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lieu du rendez-vous :</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Itinéraire :</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Veuillez planifier votre trajet en conséquence et n\'hésitez pas à nous contacter si vous avez besoin de reporter ou si vous avez des questions.</p><p>Nous sommes impatients de vous rencontrer bientôt !</p><p>Cordialement<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29653,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','ja','<p>{salutation}様、</p><p>チームとの今後の会議について、ご案内いたします。ご予約は{time_until_meeting}に予定されています。</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会議まで：</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日時：</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>所要時間：</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会議場所：</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>道順：</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>お時間に余裕を持ってお越しください。ご予約の変更やご質問がございましたら、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p><p>皆様にお会いできるのを楽しみにしております！</p><p>よろしくお願いいたします<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29654,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','es','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Este es un recordatorio amable sobre su próxima reunión con nuestro equipo. Su cita está programada en {time_until_meeting}.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Reunión en:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fecha y Hora:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Duración:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lugar de la reunión:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Indicaciones:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Por favor, planifique su viaje en consecuencia y no dude en contactarnos si necesita reprogramar o tiene alguna pregunta.</p><p>¡Esperamos verle pronto!</p><p>Saludos cordiales<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29655,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','tr','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Ekibimizle yapacağınız görüşmenizle ilgili dostça bir hatırlatmadır. Randevunuz {time_until_meeting} içinde planlanmıştır.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Toplantıya kalan süre:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Tarih ve Saat:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Süre:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Toplantı Konumu:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Yol Tarifi:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Lütfen seyahatinizi buna göre planlayın ve yeniden planlamanız veya herhangi bir sorunuz olursa bizimle iletişime geçmekten çekinmeyin.</p><p>Yakında sizinle tanışmayı dört gözle bekliyoruz!</p><p>Saygılarımızla<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29656,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','ru','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Это дружеское напоминание о вашей предстоящей встрече с нашей командой. Ваша встреча запланирована через {time_until_meeting}.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Встреча через:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата и время:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Продолжительность:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Место встречи:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Как добраться:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Пожалуйста, планируйте свою поездку соответственно и не стесняйтесь обращаться к нам, если вам нужно перенести встречу или у вас есть какие-либо вопросы.</p><p>Мы с нетерпением ждем нашей встречи с вами!</p><p>С уважением<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29657,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','uk','<p>{salutation},</p><p>Це дружнє нагадування про вашу майбутню зустріч з нашою командою. Ваша зустріч запланована через {time_until_meeting}.</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Зустріч за:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Дата та час:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Тривалість:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Місце зустрічі:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Маршрут:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Будь ласка, сплануйте свою поїздку відповідно та не соромтеся зв\'язатися з нами, якщо вам потрібно перенести зустріч або у вас виникнуть запитання.</p><p>Ми з нетерпінням чекаємо на зустріч з вами!</p><p>З повагою<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29658,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','hi','<p>{salutation},</p><p>यह हमारी टीम के साथ आपकी आगामी बैठक के बारे में एक सौहार्दपूर्ण अनुस्मारक है। आपकी अपॉइंटमेंट {time_until_meeting} में निर्धारित है।</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>बैठक का समय:</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिनांक और समय:</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अवधि:</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>बैठक का स्थान:</strong><br>{location_name}<br>{street}<br>{zip_code} {city}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🚗</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>दिशा-निर्देश:</strong> {travel_instructions}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>कृपया अपनी यात्रा की योजना तदनुसार बनाएं और यदि आपको पुनः शेड्यूल करने या कोई प्रश्न पूछने की आवश्यकता हो तो हमसे संपर्क करने में संकोच न करें।</p><p>हम जल्द ही आपसे मिलने के लिए उत्सुक हैं!</p><p>साभार<br>{partner_full_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-05 05:00:55',1),(29659,'in_person_meeting_reminder_u7mdottk','zh','<p>{salutation}，</p><p>特此提醒您与我们团队即将举行的会议。您的预约安排在{time_until_meeting}。</p><div style=\"background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>会议剩余时间：</strong> {time_until_meeting}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>日期和时间：</strong> {meeting_time}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏱️</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>时长：</strong> {duration}</td></tr><tr>