-06 15:00:34',1),(32613,'cover_mail_invoice_ufse5wmf','de','<p>{salutation}</p><p>Anbei erhalten Sie unsere E-Rechnung als PDF. Wir bedanken uns für Ihr Vertrauen und bitten um fristgerechte Zahlung.</p><div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Rechnungsnummer:</strong> {document_number}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Rechnungsdatum:</strong> {document_date}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Gesamtbetrag:</strong> {total_gross}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fälligkeitsdatum:</strong> {document_due_date}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Bei Rückfragen stehen wir Ihnen gerne zur Verfügung.</p><p>Vielen Dank für Ihr Vertrauen!</p><p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen,<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:40:34',1),(32614,'cover_mail_invoice_ufse5wmf','en','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Please find attached our e-invoice as a PDF. We thank you for your trust and kindly request timely payment.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Invoice Number:</strong> {document_number}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Invoice Date:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Total Amount:</strong> {total_gross}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Due Date:</strong> {document_due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.</p>\n<p>Thank you for your trust!</p>\n<p>Sincerely,<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:39:25',1),(32615,'cover_mail_invoice_ufse5wmf','fr','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Veuillez trouver ci-joint notre e-facture au format PDF. Nous vous remercions de votre confiance et vous prions de bien vouloir effectuer le paiement dans les délais impartis.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Numéro de facture :</strong> {document_number}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date de facture :</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;