n ausstehenden Betrag innerhalb der nächsten 10 Tage auf unser Konto zu überweisen.\n\nBei Rückfragen stehen wir Ihnen gerne zur Verfügung.\n\nMit freundlichen Grüßen\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:01',1),(32815,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','de','{salutation}\nwir stellen fest, dass Rechnung „{original_invoice}“ über {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} noch nicht bezahlt wurde. Das Fälligkeitsdatum war der {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32816,'title_template_payment_reminder','en','Payment Reminder',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32817,'title_template_payment_reminder','fr','Rappel de paiement',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32818,'title_template_payment_reminder','ja','支払いリマインダー',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32819,'title_template_payment_reminder','es','Recordatorio de Pago',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32820,'title_template_payment_reminder','tr','Ödeme Hatırlatması',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32821,'title_template_payment_reminder','ru','Напоминание об оплате',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32822,'title_template_payment_reminder','uk','Нагадування про оплату',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32823,'title_template_payment_reminder','hi','भुगतान अनुस्मारक',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32824,'title_template_payment_reminder','zh','付款提醒',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:04',1),(32825,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','en','{salutation}\nwe notice that invoice \"{original_invoice}\" for {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} has not yet been paid. The payment due date was {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32826,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','fr','{salutation}\nnous constatons que la facture «{original_invoice}» d\'un montant de {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} n\'a pas encore été réglée. La date d\'échéance était le {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32827,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','ja','{salutation}\n請求書「{original_invoice}」（{original_invoice.total_amount}{original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol}）がまだ支払われていないことを確認いたしました。支払い期日は {original_invoice.due_date} でした。',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32828,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','es','{salutation}\nhemos notado que la factura «{original_invoice}» por un importe de {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} aún no ha sido pagada. La fecha de vencimiento era el {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32829,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','tr','{salutation}\n{original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} tutarındaki „{original_invoice}“ faturasının henüz ödenmediğini fark ettik. Son ödeme tarihi {original_invoice.due_date} idi.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32830,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','ru','{salutation}\nмы заметили, что счет «{original_invoice}» на сумму {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} еще не оплачен. Срок оплаты был {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32831,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','uk','{salutation}\nми помітили, що рахунок «{original_invoice}» на суму {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} ще не сплачено. Дата оплати була {original_invoice.due_date}.',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32832,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','hi','{salutation}\nहमें पता चला है कि {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} के लिए इनवॉइस \"{original_invoice}\" का भुगतान अभी तक नहीं किया गया है। भुगतान की अंतिम तिथि {original_invoice.due_date} थी।',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32833,'intro_text_template_payment_reminder','zh','{salutation}\n我们注意到，金额为 {original_invoice.total_amount} {original_invoice.currency.currency_symbol} 的发票“{original_invoice}”尚未支付。付款截止日期是 {original_invoice.due_date}。',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-08 19:44:04',1),(32834,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','en','If you have already made the payment, please disregard this letter.\n\nIf not, we kindly ask you to transfer the outstanding amount to our account within the next 10 days.\n\nPlease do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.\n\nSincerely,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32835,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','fr','Si vous avez déjà effectué le paiement, veuillez ne pas tenir compte de cette lettre.\n\nDans le cas contraire, nous vous prions de bien vouloir virer le montant dû sur notre compte dans les 10 prochains jours.\n\nN\'hésitez pas à nous contacter pour toute question.\n\nCordialement,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32836,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','ja','既にお支払いがお済みの場合、本状はご放念ください。\n\nお済みでない場合は、10日以内に未払い金額を弊社口座へお振込みくださいますようお願い申し上げます。\n\nご不明な点がございましたら、お気軽にお問い合わせください。\n\n敬具\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32837,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','es','Si ya ha realizado el pago, ignore esta carta.\n\nEn caso contrario, le rogamos que transfiera el importe pendiente a nuestra cuenta en un plazo de 10 días.\n\nNo dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros si tiene alguna pregunta.\n\nAtentamente,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32838,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','tr','Ödemeyi zaten yaptıysanız, lütfen bu mektubu dikkate almayın.\n\nAksi takdirde, lütfen kalan tutarı 10 gün içinde hesabımıza havale etmenizi rica ederiz.\n\nHerhangi bir sorunuz olursa lütfen bizimle iletişime geçmekten çekinmeyin.\n\nSaygılarımızla,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32839,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','ru','Если вы уже произвели оплату, пожалуйста, проигнорируйте это письмо.\n\nВ противном случае, мы просим вас перевести оставшуюся сумму на наш счет в течение следующих 10 дней.\n\nПожалуйста, не стесняйтесь обращаться к нам с любыми вопросами.\n\nС уважением,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32840,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','uk','Якщо ви вже здійснили платіж, будь ласка, ігноруйте цей лист.\n\nВ іншому випадку, ми просимо вас перевести несплачену суму на наш рахунок протягом наступних 10 днів.\n\nБудь ласка, не соромтеся звертатися до нас з будь-якими питаннями.\n\nЗ повагою,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32841,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','hi','यदि आपने पहले ही भुगतान कर दिया है, तो कृपया इस पत्र को अनदेखा करें।\n\nयदि नहीं, तो हम आपसे अनुरोध करते हैं कि अगले 10 दिनों के भीतर बकाया राशि हमारे खाते में स्थानांतरित कर दें।\n\nयदि आपके कोई प्रश्न हैं तो कृपया हमसे संपर्क करने में संकोच न करें।\n\nभवदीय,\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32842,'bottom_text_template_payment_reminder','zh','如果您已完成付款，请忽略此信。\n\n如果尚未付款，我们恳请您在未来10天内将未付金额转账至我方账户。\n\n如有任何疑问，请随时与我们联系。\n\n此致，\n{company_name}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 18:58:08',1),(32843,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','en','Custom Form',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:18:40',113),(32844,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','de','Benutzerdefiniertes Formular',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:29:50',113),(32845,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','fr','Formulaire Personnalisé',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:29:50',113),(32846,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','ja','カスタムフォーム',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:29:50',113),(32847,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','es','Formulario Personalizado',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:29:50',113),(32848,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','tr','Özel Form',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-06 19:29:50',113),(32849,'resource_sales_document_type_title_custom_form','ru','Пользователь