: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Urspr&uuml;ngliche Rechnung:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Offener Betrag:</strong> {total_gross}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Urspr&uuml;ngliches F&auml;lligkeitsdatum:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Erinnerung vom:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Sollten Sie diese Rechnung bereits beglichen haben, betrachten Sie dieses Schreiben bitte als gegenstandslos.</p>\n<p>Wir bitten um zeitnahe Begleichung des offenen Betrags.</p>\n<p>Mit freundlichen Gr&uuml;&szlig;en<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-20 10:55:33',1),(32971,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','en','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Upon reviewing our accounts, we noticed that the following invoice has not yet been paid. The payment reminder is attached as a PDF.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Original Invoice:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Outstanding Amount:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Original Due Date:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Reminder from:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>If you have already settled this invoice, please disregard this letter.</p>\n<p>We kindly request prompt settlement of the outstanding amount.</p>\n<p>Kind regards,<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32972,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','fr','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Lors de la révision de notre comptabilité, nous avons constaté que la facture ci-dessous n\'a pas encore été réglée. Vous trouverez le rappel de paiement en PDF en annexe.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Facture originale :</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Montant dû :</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Date d\'échéance originale :</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Rappel du :</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Si vous avez déjà réglé cette facture, veuillez considérer ce courrier comme nul et non avenu.</p>\n<p>Nous vous prions de bien vouloir régler rapidement le montant dû.</p>\n<p>Cordialement<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32973,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','ja','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>当社の経理をチェックしたところ、下記の請求書がまだ支払われていないことが判明いたしました。支払い督促状はPDFで添付されています。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>元の請求書:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>未払い金額:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>元の支払期日:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>督促日:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>この請求書をすでにお支払い済みの場合は、この書面を破棄してください。</p>\n<p>未払い金額を速やかにお支払いいただけますようお願い申し上げます。</p>\n<p>よろしくお願いいたします<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32974,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','es','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Al revisar nuestra contabilidad, hemos notado que la siguiente factura aún no ha sido pagada. Encontrará el recordatorio de pago como PDF adjunto.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Factura original:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Importe pendiente:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fecha de vencimiento original:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Recordatorio del:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Si ya ha pagado esta factura, ignore esta comunicación.</p>\n<p>Le rogamos que abone el importe pendiente a la mayor brevedad posible.</p>\n<p>Atentamente<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32975,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','tr','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Muhasebe kayıtlarımızı incelerken, aşağıdaki faturanın henüz ödenmediğini fark ettik. Ödeme hatırlatıcısını ekte PDF olarak bulabilirsiniz.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Orijinal Fatura:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Açık Tutar:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Orijinal Vade Tarihi:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Hatırlatma Tarihi:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Bu faturayı zaten ödemiş iseniz, lütfen bu yazıyı dikkate almayın.</p>\n<p>Açık tutarın zamanında ödenmesini rica ederiz.</p>\n<p>Saygılarımızla<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32976,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','ru','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>При просмотре нашей бухгалтерии мы обратили внимание, что указанный ниже счет еще не был оплачен. Напоминание об оплате вы найдете в приложении в формате PDF.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Первоначальный счет:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Непогашенная сумма:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Первоначальный срок оплаты:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Напоминание от:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Если вы уже оплатили этот счет, просим считать это письмо недействительным.</p>\n<p>Просим своевременно погасить оставшуюся сумму.</p>\n<p>С уважением,<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32977,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','uk','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Під час перегляду нашої бухгалтерії ми помітили, що наступний рахунок ще не оплачено. Нагадування про оплату ви знайдете у вкладеному PDF-файлі.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Оригінальний рахунок:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Несплачена сума:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Початкова дата сплати:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Нагадування від:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Якщо ви вже сплатили цей рахунок, будь ласка, вважайте цей лист недійсним.</p>\n<p>Просимо своєчасно погасити несплачену суму.</p>\n<p>З повагою<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32978,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','hi','<p>{salutation}<\n</p>\n<p>हमारी लेखा-जोखा की समीक्षा के दौरान, हमने पाया है कि नीचे दिया गया बिल अभी तक चुकाया नहीं गया है। भुगतान अनुस्मारक आपको अनुलग्नक में PDF के रूप में मिलेगा।</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #fff3e0; border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>मूल बिल:</strong> {original_invoice}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>बकाया राशि:</strong> {amount} {currency}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⏰</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>मूल देय तिथि:</strong> {due_date}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अनुस्मारक की तिथि:</strong> {document_date}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>यदि आपने इस बिल का भुगतान पहले ही कर दिया है, तो कृपया इस पत्र को निरर्थक मानें।</p>\n<p>हम आपसे बकाया राशि का शीघ्र भुगतान करने का अनुरोध करते हैं।</p>\n<p>साभार<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-07 05:11:44',1),(32979,'cover_mail_payment_reminder_gt9jb7dn','zh','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>在核对我们的账目时，我们注意到以下发票尚未支付。您可以在附件中找到付款提醒的PDF文件。</p>\n<div style=