议链接',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:40:08',113),(33696,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','en','Calendar Event Video Meeting Confirmed',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:05',1),(33697,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','en','📅 Meeting Confirmed: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:05',1),(33698,'message_wbospbpx','en','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>Thank you for confirming your participation! Your video meeting has been confirmed and here are your meeting details:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Title:</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Start:</strong> {event_start}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>End:</strong> {event_end}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Location:</strong> {event_venue}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Description:</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Your Status:</strong> {participant_status}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💻</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Video Meeting Link:</strong><br><a style=\"background-color: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px;\" href=\"{video_meeting_link}\">Join Video Meeting</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Please save the video meeting link and join at the scheduled time. Make sure your camera and microphone are working properly.</p>\n<p>If you need to make any changes or have technical questions, please don\'t hesitate to contact us.</p>\n<p>We look forward to meeting with you!</p>\n<p>Best regards<br>{inviter_full_name}<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:06',1),(33699,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','de','📅 Besprechung bestätigt: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33700,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','fr','📅 Réunion confirmée : {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33701,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','ja','📅 会議が確定しました：{event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33702,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','es','📅 Reunión confirmada: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33703,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','tr','📅 Toplantı Onaylandı: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33704,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','ru','📅 Встреча подтверждена: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33705,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','uk','📅 Зустріч підтверджено: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33706,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','hi','📅 मीटिंग की पुष्टि हो गई: {event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33707,'subject_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','zh','📅 会议已确认：{event_title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:07',1),(33708,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','de','Kalenderereignis Videokonferenz Bestätigt',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33709,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','fr','Événement de calendrier : Réunion vidéo confirmée',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33710,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','ja','カレンダーイベントのビデオ会議が確認されました',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33711,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','es','Evento de calendario: Reunión por vídeo confirmada',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33712,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','tr','Takvim Etkinliği Görüntülü Toplantı Onaylandı',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33713,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','ru','Событие календаря: Видеовстреча подтверждена',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33714,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','uk','Подія календаря: Відеозустріч підтверджено',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33715,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','hi','कैलेंडर इवेंट वीडियो मीटिंग की पुष्टि हो गई है',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33716,'title_calendar_event_video_meeting_confirmed','zh','日历事件视频会议已确认',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:24:10',1),(33717,'message_wbospbpx','de','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>Vielen Dank für die Bestätigung Ihrer Teilnahme! Ihr Videomeeting wurde bestätigt und hier sind Ihre Meeting-Details:</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Titel:</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Start:</strong> {event_start}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ende:</strong> {event_end}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ort:</strong> {event_venue}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Beschreibung:</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ihr Status:</strong> {participant_status}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💻</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Link zum Videomeeting:</strong><br><a style=\"background-color: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px;\" href=\"{video_meeting_link}\">Am Videomeeting teilnehmen</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Bitte speichern Sie den Link zum Videomeeting und nehmen Sie zum geplanten Zeitpunkt teil. Stellen Sie sicher, dass Kamera und Mikrofon ordnungsgemäß funktionieren.</p>\n<p>Wenn Sie Änderungen vornehmen müssen oder technische Fragen haben, zögern Sie bitte nicht, uns zu kontaktieren.</p>\n<p>Wir freuen uns darauf, Sie zu treffen!</p>\n<p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{inviter_full_name}<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:25:44',1),(33718,'message_wbospbpx','fr','<p>{salutation},</p>\n<p>Merci d\'avoir confirmé votre participation ! Votre réunion vidéo a été confirmée et voici les détails de votre réunion :</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Titre :</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Début :</strong> {event_start}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fin :</strong> {event_end}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lieu :</strong> {event_venue}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Description :</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Votre statut :</strong> {participant_status}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💻</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Lien de la réunion vidéo :</strong><br><a style=\"background-color: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px;\" href=\"{video_meeting_link}\">Rejoindre la réunion vidéo</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Veuillez enregistrer le lien de la réunion vidéo et y participer à l\'heure prévue. Assurez-vous que votre caméra et votre microphone fonctionnent correctement.</p>\n<p>Si vous avez besoin d\'apporter des modifications ou si vous avez des questions techniques, n\'hésitez pas à nous contacter.</p>\n<p>Nous avons hâte de vous rencontrer !</p>\n<p>Cordialement<br>{inviter_full_name}<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:25:44',1),(33719,'message_wbospbpx','ja','<p>{salutation}様、</p>\n<p>ご参加の確定ありがとうございます！ビデオ会議が確定いたしました。会議の詳細は以下の通りです。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>タイトル:</strong> {event_title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>開始:</strong> {event_start}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>終了:</strong> {event_end}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>場所:</strong> {event_venue}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>説明:</strong> {event_description}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✅</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>お客様のステータス:</strong> {participant_status}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">💻</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>ビデオ会議リンク:</strong><br><a style=\"background-color: #2196f3; color: #ffffff; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px;\" href=\"{video_meeting_link}\">ビデオ会議に参加</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>ビデオ会議リンクを保存し、予定時刻にご参加ください。カメラとマイクが正常に動作していることをご確認ください。</p>\n<p>変更が必要な場合や技術的なご質問がある場合は、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p>\n<p>皆様にお会いできるのを楽しみにしています！</p>\n<p>よろしくお願いいたします<br>{inviter_full_name}<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-09-12 06:25:44',1),(33720,'message_wbospbpx','es','<p>{salutation},</p><p>¡Gracias por confirmar su participación! Su videollamada ha sido confirmada y aquí están los detalles de su reunión:</p><div style=\"background-color: #e8f5e8; border-left: 5px solid #2e7d32; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📅</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Título:</strong> {event_title}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕐</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Inicio:</strong> {event_start}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🕑</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Fin:</strong> {event_end}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📍</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Ubicación:</strong> {event_venue}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📝</span></td><td style=\"padding: