22 08:13:57',113),(34365,'resource_contract_template_title_description','hi','हस्ताक्षरकर्ताओं के लिए अनुबंध का संक्षिप्त विवरण',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:13:57',113),(34366,'resource_contract_template_title_description','zh','签署人合同简要说明',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:13:57',113),(34367,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','de','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Ein neuer Vertrag steht zur Unterschrift bereit.&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📜</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Vertragsname:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0px; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✒️<br></span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0px; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div>\n<div><a href=\"{contract_link}\">Vertrag anzeigen und unterschreiben</a></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0px; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📋<br></span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0px; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>Beschreibung:</strong> {description}</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>Sollten Sie Fragen haben oder eine Kl&auml;rung ben&ouml;tigen, z&ouml;gern Sie bitte nicht, uns zu kontaktieren.</p>\n<p>Mit freundlichen Gr&uuml;&szlig;en<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-12-10 08:00:59',1),(34368,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','en','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>A new contract is available for your signature. Please review the attached document and sign it promptly if you agree.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Contract Name:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>If you have any questions or require clarification, please do not hesitate to contact us.</p>\n<p>Sincerely<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:21:59',1),(34369,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','fr','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Un nouveau contrat est disponible pour votre signature. Veuillez examiner le document ci-joint et le signer rapidement si vous êtes d\'accord.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Nom du contrat :</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>Si vous avez des questions ou si vous souhaitez des précisions, n\'hésitez pas à nous contacter.</p>\n<p>Cordialement<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34370,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','ja','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>新しい契約書が署名のために利用可能です。添付文書をご確認いただき、同意される場合は速やかにご署名ください。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>契約名:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>ご不明な点やご質問がございましたら、お気軽にお問い合わせください。</p>\n<p>敬具<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34371,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','es','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Hay un nuevo contrato disponible para su firma. Por favor, revise el documento adjunto y fírmelo sin demora si está de acuerdo.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Nombre del contrato:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>Si tiene alguna pregunta o necesita alguna aclaración, no dude en ponerse en contacto con nosotros.</p>\n<p>Atentamente<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34372,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','tr','<p>{salutation}</p><p>İmzalamanız için yeni bir sözleşme mevcut. Lütfen ekteki belgeyi inceleyin ve kabul ediyorsanız derhal imzalayın.</p><div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td><td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Sözleşme Adı:</strong> {title}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>{description}</p><p>Herhangi bir sorunuz varsa veya açıklama talep ediyorsanız, lütfen bizimle iletişime geçmekten çekinmeyin.</p><p>Saygılarımızla<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34373,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','ru','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Для вашей подписи доступен новый договор. Пожалуйста, ознакомьтесь с прикрепленным документом и оперативно подпишите его, если вы согласны.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Название договора:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>Если у вас возникнут вопросы или потребуется разъяснение, пожалуйста, не стесняйтесь обращаться к нам.</p>\n<p>С уважением,<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34374,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','uk','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>Доступний новий контракт для вашого підпису. Будь ласка, перегляньте доданий документ і оперативно підпишіть його, якщо ви згодні.</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>Назва контракту:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>Якщо у вас виникнуть питання або потрібні роз\'яснення, будь ласка, не соромтеся зв\'язатися з нами.</p>\n<p>З повагою<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34375,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','hi','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>आपके हस्ताक्षर के लिए एक नया अनुबंध उपलब्ध है। कृपया संलग्न दस्तावेज़ की समीक्षा करें और यदि आप सहमत हैं तो तुरंत हस्ताक्षर करें।</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>अनुबंध का नाम:</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>यदि आपके कोई प्रश्न हैं या स्पष्टीकरण की आवश्यकता है, तो कृपया हमसे संपर्क करने में संकोच न करें।</p>\n<p>भवदीय<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34376,'cover_mail_contract_xha65ajk','zh','<p>{salutation}</p>\n<p>一份新合同已可供您签署。请审阅所附文件，如同意请尽快签署。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color: #dce2e8; border-left: 5px solid #007bff; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top; width: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📄</span></td>\n<td style=\"padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;\"><strong>合同名称：</strong> {title}</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>{description}</p>\n<p>如果您有任何问题或需要澄清，请随时与我们联系。</p>\n<p>此致<br>{company_name}</p>',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 15:22:44',1),(34377,'title_cover_mail_contract','en','Cover Letter for Contract',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34378,'subject_cover_mail_contract','de','Vertrag zur Unterschrift liegt vor - {title}',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34379,'title_cover_mail_contract','fr','Lettre d\'accompagnement pour contrat',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34380,'title_cover_mail_contract','ja','契約用送付状',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34381,'title_cover_mail_contract','es','Carta de presentación para contrato',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34382,'title_cover_mail_contract','tr','Sözleşme için üst yazı',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34383,'title_cover_mail_contract','ru','Сопроводительное письмо к договору',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34384,'title_cover_mail_contract','uk','Супровідний лист до договору',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22 08:49:46',1),(34385,'title_cover_mail_contract','hi','अनुबंध के लिए कवर लेटर',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2025-11-22